{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gearbound: Odyssey</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a fast-paced first-person platformer inspired by the early <i>Ratchet &amp; Clank</i> games but with a twist: it\u2019s all in first-person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, blast, and explore your way across a variety of vibrant, handcrafted planets. Each level brings something new to the table from towering industrial complexes to lush alien jungles  packed with platforming challenges, hidden secrets, and a wild cast of enemies to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll collect unique weapons and gadgets as you go, giving you new ways to fight and explore. Whether it\u2019s hopping across floating platforms or using high-tech tools to reach hidden areas, movement and creativity are at the heart of the adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gearbound: Odyssey</strong> mixes classic platformer vibes with the intensity and immersion of a first-person perspective. It\u2019s all about tight movement, satisfying combat, and that feeling of discovery as you uncover what\u2019s waiting on the next world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Stages:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/Verdant_Rise.png?t=1744310972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Items:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Codex Entry:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cEvery journey starts with a spark. The Conduit may not look like much now but give it time, and it\u2019ll carry your will across the ruins of the old world.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/Staff.png?t=1744310972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Codex Entry:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cStone conceals. Light remembers. The truth of the past lies dormant in these fractured cores, whispering through time for someone to listen.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/HDD.png?t=1744310972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Actors:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ember:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chomper:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grenadier:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">N/A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>All Game Code:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authored by <strong>EvolvedPhoenix</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Assets Utilized:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Game Kit Character Pack<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/CharacterPack.png?t=1744310972\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Game Kit Props Pack<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/PropsPack.png?t=1744310972\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Game Kit Environment Pack<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/extras/EnvironmentPack.png?t=1744310972\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612790?t=1744310972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/4b6b32bb52728fac62c6673d856afc91c92111a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744310972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612790/0f2af5840f1a6bcdd788dd984d1e50ea77d1c3c5/capsule_231x87.